<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timothi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Khrist Jesu a um hinna thuchiem dungzui a Pasian dei lam a Jesu Khrist sawltah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tapa ittah Timothi kungah, Pa Pasian leh Khrist Jesu i Mangpa uh kunga kipat hepina leh khotuona leh lungmuonna umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sun leh zan a tawplou a ka thungetnate a ka hing thei ngitnget ziehin, ka pu leh pate akipat a, sie leh pha theina siengtah nei a, a nna ka sep Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hituite ka thei ngitnget a, ka lungnopna akim theina dingin, nangma hing mu ding ka lunggul mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ginna tuoilou nangma a um khu ka ngaituotah chiengin, tua ginna khu amasapen in na pi Loisi ah aum a, na nu Eunisi ah zong aum a, tualeh nangma ah zong a um chi ka theichien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuazieh in na tunga ka khut ngap zieh a Pasian silpieh nangma a um mutkuong dingin ka hing theisah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in zauna hagau ahing pe sih a, hinanleh silbawltheina, itna leh kithununna hagau ahing pe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin i Mangpa thu theipina khu zumpi sinlen, Ama hentapa kei zong hing zumpi sin, hinanleh khantanhoi zieha ka gentheinate Pasian silbawltheina dungzui in hing thuohpi zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman inasepte dungzui hilou in, Ama guot leh ahepina dungzui in ahing hundam a, hatna siengthou in ahing hanta hi, tuakhu hun kipat masang a Khrist Jesu a ahing pieh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh i hundampa Jesu Khrist hing kilahna ziehin, tuin sulat in a umta hi, Aman shina subei in khantanhoi zal in hinna leh shitheilouna khu vah ah ahing tunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khantanhoi thu Jentelte theisah dingin thugentu ding leh sawltah ding leh thuhiltu dingin kei ahing guotta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamte ziehin, Ken zong tam silte ka thuoh ahi, ahivangin ka zum sih hi, aziehpen ka gintatpa ka thei hi, tualeh Ama ka kepsah khu tua ni a dingin, akembit thei chi chientah in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a um ginna leh itna nei in, kithuhilna chidam huoi ka kunga kipata na zahte khu tudet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sil hoi na kunga hing kikemsah khu, eima sunga Hagau Siengthou um in kem hoi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia gam a um zousie in Kei ahing kiheimangsanta uh chi na thei hi, amaute lah ah Phigelas leh Hermogenes atel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n Onesiphorus innkuonpite kungah khotuona pie hen, aziehpen ama’n ahing suhal zelzel a, ka siakhainieng bu zong azumpi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama Rom khuo ahing tun tahin, phattuomngai tahin Kei ahing sui a, ahing mudoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman tua ni chienga, Mangpa a kipata khotuona amu ding, Mangpa’n phalpieh hen, tualeh aman Ephesa khuo ah lam tampi ah kei hing panpi in nna asem hi, chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang ka tapa aw, Khrist Jesu a um hepina ah hattah in um in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theipitu tampite lah a ka thugen na zahte, mi muonhuoi, midangte zong hilsawn thei dingte kungah kemsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuazieh in Jesu Khrist galkap hoitah bangin hasatnate hing thuohpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Galkap a pang dinga telpa akipahsah theina dingin galkap koima kidou lai in tam damsung khosahnate in akisubuoi ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh kidemnate bangah mi pang nanleh zong dan dungzui a abawl sih leh, guolzawna lukhu khuhsah in a um ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lou neimi gimtah a nasem in asepgim gate ne masapa ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thugen ngaituo detdet in, Mangpa’n sil zousie ah theisiemna ahing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David suon a pieng Jesu Khrist khu, ka khantan hoi gen dungzuiin, mishi lah a kipat kaithaw in a um hi chi thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam khantanhoi ziehin gitlouna bawl mi banga thuohsah in ka um a, siakhainienga kaan in hasatna ka thuoh hi, hinanleh Pasian thu pen kaan in a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin tel tuomte ziehin sil zousie ka thuoh teitei hi, tuachia amauten zong Khrist Jesu a um hundam na khu kumtawn a thupina toh amu sam theina dingun ka thuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thugen agintat huoi ahi: Ama toh shi khawm i hi taah leh, Ama toh i hingkhawm ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ithuoh u’leh, Ama toh vai ihawm khawm dinga, Ama ikitheimawbawl leh, Aman zong ahing kitheimaw bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eite muonhuoi sih nanlei zong, Ama pen amuonhuoi ngitnget a, Ama leh ama akitheimawbawl thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam silte amauh theisah kia inlen, thu phattuomlou, angaikhemite a dinga, manthaina hi giap thu a kiniel lou dingin, Mangpa mai ah hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thutah, thu dihtah in khen in, nasem mi zumna ding neilou bangin, Pasian pomtah hi dinga nangma kipe dingin theitawpsuo in kizil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian zatatlouna thu gen a kamtamte kiheimangsan in, aziehpen amauten Pasian ngaisahlouna lam ah mite apui gamla deudeu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh athuzilsahte uh hima damtheilou bangin adalzah ding hi. Ama ute lah ah Himeneus leh Philetus apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amauten thutah apielsan ua, thawkiana a um zouta achi ua, mi pawlkhatte ginna asuhsiet pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahivang in Pasian suongphum dettahin adinga, tam chiemtena anei hi, “Mangpa’n Ama ate athei hi,” tualeh “Khrist minlou pouma in gitlouna kiheimangsan heh,” chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh inn thupi sungah, sana leh dangka belte guoh a um sih a, sing leh leibel a kibawl zong a um hi, pawlkhatte manphatah a zah, pawlkhatte manphaloutah a zah ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi koipou tam silte lah a kipat a akihepkhiet leh, um leh bel manphatah a zah ding a siengthou Mangpa zat taah, na hoi chinteng sem dinga mansa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangdawng utna giloute zong taisan inlen, hinanleh lungtang siengtah a Mangpa min loute toh, dihtatna, ginna, itna leh kilemnate delzaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh amot huoi leh theiloupi a kinielnate pumpel in, tuate’n kihauna apiengsah chi thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa nasem mi a dingin mi toh kihau ding ahi sih hi, hinanleh mi zousie tunga, nunnem, thuhil siem, thuohhat, ahi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama nielkalte nunnem tah a thu ahil leh Pasian in amaute akisiasah dinga thutah theina ah apui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh dawimangpa in ama deilam bawl dinga sal a amatna akipat amaute hing kiphawh in dawimangpa thanga kipat asuohta thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh tam zong thei in, ni nukhia lam ah hun hasate ahing um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen mi ama uleh amauh ki itte, sum ngainate, ki uongsahte, kisatheite, Pasian gensete, nulepa thumangloute, kipahdan theiloute, siengthou loute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Itna neiloute, ngaidamna neiloute, mi sietna ding bawlte, kidehtheiloute, mi huhamte, hoideiloute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lepchiete, ngongtatte, kingaisangte, Pasian it sanga nopsahna it zawte ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian ngaisahna bahna anei ding ua, hinanleh asilbawltheina atahsang sih ding uhi; tambang mite kinuaheisan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambang mite pen mi innchin ah ava lut ua, numei khelna puohgih puo, numei mo deute sala mana utna tuom tuoma puimangte, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tambang numeite pen zil ngitnget napi a thutah thei pha ngailoute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jannes leh Jambres in Mosi adou bangun, tam miten zong thutah adou uhi, mi lungsim kisegawp, ginna lam a Pasian deilou mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute amasawn sih ding uhi, aziehpen amaute gel bangin amotna uh mi zousie kungah akilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen in ka thuhilna, ka hindan, ka tup leh ngim, ka ginna, ka gimthuohna, ka itna leh ka kukaldan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawlsietna leh hasatna ka thuohte, Antiok khuo, Ikonium khuo leh Listra khuo a ka tunga siltungte zousie, bawlsietna ka thuohte na theikim sieng hi; hinanleh Mangpa’n tuate akipat kei ahing hundoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, Khrist Jesu a Pasian ngaisah a hin ut pouma in bawlsietna athuoh ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh migilou leh mi lepchiete ase semsem ding ua, mite asol ding ua, miten zong amaute asol ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen na zil sa leh na theichiensa ah um zing inlen, tamte koi kung a kipata na zil a, na theichien ahiei, chi na thei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh na naupan lai a pat in, Khrist Jesu a ginna zieh a hundamna mu dinga nang hing hilpil thei laisiengthou thei na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laisiengthou zousie Pasian huhakhuma pieh ahi a, thuhil na ding, phawhhilna ding, bawlhoina ding, leh dihtatna lam a kithuhilna dingin aphatuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian mi khu nasep hoi chinteng sem dinga kimtah a kithuoma abukim theina dingin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian masang leh Ama leh aleenggam hing kilat chienga mihing leh mishite thukhen pieh dingpa Mangpa Jesu Khrist mai ah tam mawpuohna ka hing guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu gen in, ahun leh ahunlou ah zong mansa in um in. Thuzaw inlen, phawhhil inlen, thuohtheina zousie leh thuhil pum in hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amauten thuhilna dih angaikhiet ngaplou hun uh hing tung ding ahi, hinanleh thu ngainuom a bildaw ahizieh un, amauh deilam gen dingin thuhilmi akhawm ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh thutah akipat abilte uh aheimang ding ua, tangthu bulbal neiloute lam ah abildaw zawta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen sil zousie ah pilvang inlen, hasatna thuoh inlen, sawltah nna sem in, na nasepna khu sutangtungin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen tuin keipen dawn sillat banga sunbuoh a um ka hita a, ka peidoh hun atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken kidouna hoi ka douta a, kitaidemna ka zouta hi, ginna ka kemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin dihtatna mang lukhu kei a dingin koi in a umta, tua khu Mangpa vaihawmpa dihtah in tua ni chiengin kei ahing pe ding hi, tualeh kei kung guoh ah hilouin, Ama hing kilahna ngaina poumate kungah zong ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kintah in ka kungah hing pei pai tei tei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Demas in tulai leitung a it mama ziehin Kei ang taisanta a, Thessalonika khuo ah apeita hi; Kresen Galatia gam ah apeita hi, Tita zong Dalmatia gam ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luke maimai ka kungah a um hi, Mak hing chiel inlen, hing zawpi in, nasepna lam ah ama kei a dingin aphatuom mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tikikus pen Ephesa khuo ah ka sawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hing pei chiengin Troas khuo a Karpus kung a puonahtuol ka nuasie khu laibute toh hing puo in, adieh in savun laibu zielte hing puo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alekzandar, sumsan khengpa ka tungah agilou mama hi, Mangpa’n anasep dungzui in athuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang zong ama akipat pilvang mama in, aziehpen ama’n ithuhilte adou nasa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka dihna thu ka gen masah lai in Koima’n ang dinpi sih a, mi zousie in ahing taisan sieng zawta uhi, a mawna uh kipuoh se da ta u heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n ahing dinpi a, ahing suhat ta hi, tuachia kei zieha khantanhoi kimtaha akigen thei a, Jentelte zousie in azah theina ding un, tualeh humpibahnei kam sung apat hutdohin ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n gitlouna nasep chinteng akipat kei ahing hundoh dinga, Avanlam leenggam a dingin bittah in ahing humbit ding hi. Ama kungah kumtawnin thupina um tawntungta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priska leh Akuila tualeh Onesiphorus innkuonte ka nousiet hi, hing na gen pieh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erastus khu Korinth khuo ah a um denta hi; Trophimus ahileh Miletus khuo ah damlou in ka nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phalbi masangin hing pei sawm chinten in, Eubulus in mangpha ahing hah hi, tualeh Puden, Linus, Klaudia leh unaute’n zong mangpha ang hah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu Khrist in na hagau umpita hen, hepina na kungah um hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
